# ArbitrageX v2 — .gitignore
# Never commit secrets, local data, or build artifacts.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.mcp.example
# NOTE: .env.mcp (REAL MCP secrets) stays IGNORED via the .env.* rule above.
#       Only the .env.mcp.example TEMPLATE (placeholders only) is tracked.
secrets/
# Operator secrets SSOT workbook — NEVER commit (real credentials live here).
*Secrets_Config.xlsx
ArbitrageX_Secrets_Config.xlsx
# Office lock files (~$name.xlsx) materialise while a workbook is open and are
# pure noise in `git status` (AUDIT-2026-09-29 hygiene).
~$*
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx
signer.txt
.htpasswd

# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
# Workspace root lockfile — REQUIRED to be tracked because the searcher-rs
# Dockerfile builds with `--locked --frozen` (offline mode). Untracking it
# regresses the build — see commit 621776a context. Per audit 2026-05-10
# M5, this is the ONLY Cargo.lock exception — non-workspace crates do not
# have standalone tracked locks.
!/backend/Cargo.lock

# Node / TS
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Cloudflare
.wrangler/
.dev.vars
wrangler.toml.local

# Python (tools)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json.example
*.swp

# Local data
data/
logs/
tmp/
*.sqlite
*.db

# Playwright
tests/e2e/node_modules/
tests/e2e/playwright-report/
tests/e2e/playwright-report-live/
tests/e2e/test-results/
tests/e2e/.playwright-cache/
# Playwright MCP scratch workspace (browser sessions) — never commit run output.
.playwright-mcp/

# Docker
docker-compose.override.yml

# Vault TLS certs (N4 audit 2026-05-10) — generated at boot, never committed.
monitoring/vault/tls/

# Thanos objstore.yml — rendered at deploy from objstore.yml.tpl via envsubst
# using MINIO creds from .env. The rendered file holds real S3 credentials;
# only the .tpl template is tracked. §33 no-secrets-in-versioned-files.
monitoring/thanos/objstore.yml

# OMEGA-S5/audit-fixes-20260516: exclude delivery zips from repo
# (existing committed zips will be removed in a separate cleanup PR)
*.zip
!docs/**/*.zip
!tests/**/*.zip
OMEGA_S5_*_DELIVERY*.zip

# AI tooling generado / no-portable — NO va al repo de producción.
# .roo/: 565 stubs auto-generados (no reproducibles: input local en Downloads).
# extract-skills.js: generador con path local hardcodeado.
# skill-667: off-topic (education/learning), vive en user-scope ~/.claude.
# 567-skills-catalog.md: 1.4M de bloat duplicado del fuente de .roo.
.roo/
scripts/extract-skills.js
.claude/skills/skill-667-applied-education-technology-and-learning-sciences/
.claude/skills/arbitragex-omega-supreme-agent/references/567-skills-catalog.md
.env.enc
ArbitrageX_Secrets_Config.xlsx
# Office lock files (~$name.xlsx) materialise while a workbook is open and are
# pure noise in `git status` (AUDIT-2026-09-29 hygiene).
~$*
# RU-2 — canonical math catalog XLSX is operator-local source of truth; only the
# distilled cartridges/manifests/math_map.json is committed (scripts/gen_math_manifest.py).
ArbitrageX_264_Cartridge_Math_Architecture*.xlsx
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json.bak
# GATE-SECRETOS-01 (2026-10-05, E-7 follow-up): the session-local sibling above had
# NO `.pre-*.bak` rule while its harness counterpart (.claude/settings.json) did.
# Measured on this checkout: a real
# `.claude/settings.local.json.pre-oauth-isolation-20260918_175656.bak` sat there
# UNIGNORED (git check-ignore -> exit 1), so one `git add -A` would have published
# an operator-local settings backup. Same class as the E-7 file — never tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json.pre-*.bak
# AUDIT-2026-09-29 (SECRETS-TRACKED-01): .claude/settings.json is an OPERATOR-LOCAL
# file (harness/LLM routing config incl. ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN). It was tracked and
# therefore published in a PUBLIC repo with secret-scanning disabled. Never track it
# again: the session-local counterpart above is already ignored for the same reason.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.json.bak
.claude/settings.json.pre-*.bak

# AUDIT-2026-09-29 (SECRETS-TRACKED-01): .env.crucible is an OPERATOR-LOCAL testnet
# env holding REAL explorer API keys (ETHERSCAN/ARBISCAN/POLYGONSCAN). The `.env.*`
# rule above is neutralised for this path by an explicit `!` negation elsewhere in
# history; ignoring it explicitly makes the intent unambiguous. Keep only a
# placeholder template if one is needed.
.env.crucible
.env.venice

# RunFullSyncCycle (FASE 2): operator credential manifests NEVER live in the repo
# (env ARBX_CRED_MANIFEST points at a path outside the checkout). Defensive
# ignore in case one lands here — gitleaks would flag it, but git must not.
credentials-manifest*.json
cred-manifest*.json
!scripts/credentials-manifest.example.json

# 0016 (WP-F): exclusiones deliberadas del commit de integración
# - scratchpad/: harnesses/evidencia viva local (política de checkpoints)
# - .ai-work/: registro de coordinación del protocolo (local-only)
# - .tmp-e2e/, ci-artifacts/: probes temporales de sesiones
# - .next-*/: distDir aislados por instancia (hook NEXT_DIST_DIR, FE-0053)
# - /exchange-settled.yml: dump aria de probe (evidencia puntual)
scratchpad/
.ai-work/
.tmp-e2e/
ci-artifacts/
.next-*/
/exchange-settled.yml
.worktrees/
